# Purpose: Extract only open P1 requests for the daily support triage queue.
# Inputs: queue/requests.psv: pipe-separated request ID, state, priority, summary, and owner.
# Outputs: reports/urgent-requests.psv: matching request records; stdout echoes the saved queue.
accept requests_path as text with default "queue/requests.psv"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["reports"]
run cat with path requests_path
pipe to grep with pattern "|OPEN|P1|" and flags ["-F"]
then save to "reports/urgent-requests.psv"
